# Allow only build inputs. Host dependencies, caches, docs, Git history and
# agent skills never enter the context, including untracked files.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!postcss.config.mjs
!src/
!src/**
!public/
!public/**
!deploy/
!deploy/aws/

# Keep secrets and agent files out even if nested under a build input.
**/.env*
**/.npmrc
**/.yarnrc*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials*
**/secrets
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.git
**/.agents
**/.claude
**/.opencode
**/skills
**/node_modules
**/.next*
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/skills-lock.json

# The one .pem that is not a secret: Amazon's public RDS CA bundle, copied into
# the image so the database connection can be verified. Re-allowed after the
# `**/*.pem` rule above, since the last matching rule wins.
!deploy/aws/rds-global-bundle.pem
